128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (One of the things I have been reminded of very quickly since coming back is just how much need there is here.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (Kisiizi has earned itself a reputation for helping people who are struggling. Whether someone is sick, facing a difficult pregnancy, unable to afford the care they need, or simply arrives at the hospital in a desperate situation, there is a strong desire to find a way to help. It is one of the things I admire most about this place.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
