/T (I think I am particularly aware of it because I am aware of my own limitations, too. There are things I don't know. There are situations I cannot fix. There are patients I cannot make well simply because I wish I could. There are days when I am tired, my Rukiga is nowhere near where I want it to be, and I am very conscious that I am trying to do my best with what I have.)
/E (I think I am particularly aware of it because I am aware of my own limitations, too. There are things I don't know. There are situations I cannot fix. There are patients I cannot make well simply because I wish I could. There are days when I am tired, my Rukiga is nowhere near where I want it to be, and I am very conscious that I am trying to do my best with what I have.)
/Pg 15 0 R
