/P 67 0 R
/T (The Bible is full of people who were asked to do something with what they had, even when what they had didn't seem like enough. Moses had a staff. David had a sling. A widow had a little oil. And a crowd of thousands had five loaves and two fish.)
/E (The Bible is full of people who were asked to do something with what they had, even when what they had didn't seem like enough. Moses had a staff. David had a sling. A widow had a little oil. And a crowd of thousands had five loaves and two fish.)
