/P 67 0 R
/T (The disciples looked at what they had and knew it wasn't enough. But Jesus wasn't asking them to have enough. He was asking them to bring what they had.)
/E (The disciples looked at what they had and knew it wasn't enough. But Jesus wasn't asking them to have enough. He was asking them to bring what they had.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
