179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (When I began preparing to return to Kisiizi for three years, I wasn't sure how the financial side would come together. I am incredibly grateful that, through the generosity of so many people, I now have 33 monthly financial partners and have surpassed my original pre-departure fundraising goal.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (This support has given me greater stability as I settle into life here, particularly while navigating things like work permit delays and the unexpected costs that come with living overseas. It has also given me the freedom to respond to needs around me, from helping provide diapers, clothing, formula and other necessities for baby Blessing to supporting a close friend and young mother of two who recently lost her husband.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (I am deeply grateful to everyone who has made this possible. Your generosity has allowed me not only to be here, but to have something to share when a need arises.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (While I have surpassed my initial goal, new monthly partners are still very welcome. Ongoing support helps make this three-year commitment sustainable and gives me the flexibility to respond to needs as they arise.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
